# `package-lock.json` at the root IS versioned on purpose: without it every
# `npm install` resolves a different tree, and this project ships a native
# module (better-sqlite3) plus an Electron binary whose Chromium decodes the
# operator's own media. An installer built twice has to be the same installer.
# The legacy app's lockfile is not: `legacy/` is frozen reference material.
legacy/package-lock.json
